ft:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.0000\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Secret%20Library\">Secret Library</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThis boss is part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Secret%20Library%20Quest\">final battle</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Secret%20Library%20Quest\">the Secret Library Quest</a>, check it for more context.\n</p><p>Enter the teleport to the <i>northeast</i>. Inside, you will find <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Spellstealer\">The Spellstealer</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Slave\">Demon Slaves</a>. The boss is invulnerable to all attacks on its <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Destructor</strong> (Red) and <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Spellstealer%20%28Creator%29\">Creator</a> (Green) forms. To make it vulnerable, players must lure it to the vortex corresponding to its color: \n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Spellstealer%20%28Creator%29\"><img alt=\"The Spellstealer (Creator)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Spellstealer_Creator_d88a2e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> if the boss is green, lure it northwest to the green vortex (<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The creation vortex consumes the stolen energy!</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Spellstealer%20%28Destructor%29\"><img alt=\"The Spellstealer (Destructor)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Spellstealer_Destructor_1e24bc.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> if the boss is red, lure it southeast to the red vortex (<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The destruction vortex consumes the stolen energy!</span>)</li></ul>\n<p>When the boss steps on the correct vortex, it changes to a light gray color and becomes vulnerable. After some time being hit, it will become invulnerable again (<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The spellstealer absorbs the power of destruction!</span> or <span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The spellstealer absorbs the power of creation!</span>), and it will have to be lured to the corresponding vortex. Repeat this until it is killed and then go back to the central chamber where a new raid will start (<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">After the death of the spellstealer the invasion of the central chamber continues!</span>) with the addition of <a href=\"#/wiki/Invading%20Demon\">Invading Demons</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"8731b3419998de290b2a1db8ea2821d9\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:148px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-The_Secret_Library_Quest_-_Spellstealer-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:146px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Killing The Spellstealer\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Killing The Spellstealer\" height=\"146\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Secret_Library_Quest_Spellstealer_849781.png\" style=\"\" title=\"The Secret Library Quest - Spellstealer.png (598 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Killing The Spellstealer</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Archdemons\">Archdemons</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\">Annihilon</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghazbaran\">Ghazbaran</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golgordan\">Golgordan</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgorak\">Hellgorak</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Latrivan\">Latrivan</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Madareth\">Madareth</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morgaroth\">Morgaroth</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rift%20Spawn\">Rift Spawn</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Spellstealer\">The Spellstealer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Spellstealer%20%28Creator%29\">The Spellstealer (Creator)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ushuriel\">Ushuriel</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zugurosh\">Zugurosh</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div> </div>","quests":[]}